## 🏗️ Implementation

### Location
- **Template**: `core/dashboard/templates/meta_dashboard.html`
- **Route**: `/portal`
- **URL**: `http://localhost:3060/portal`
- **Production**: `http://goliath:3060/portal` (via Tailscale)

### Architecture

```
Meta-Dashboard (/portal)
├── Knowledge Level Selector
├── Statistics Bar
├── Info Panel (adapts to knowledge level)
└── Dashboard Cards Grid
    ├── MyAI Dashboard
    ├── MCP Demo Dashboard
    ├── Bob & Alice
    ├── Gemini Tools (VeoGen)
    ├── MyWienerLinien
    ├── Grafana
    └── Prometheus
```

### Adding New Dashboards

Edit `meta_dashboard.html` JavaScript:

```javascript
const dashboards = [
    {
        id: "my-new-dashboard",
        name: "My New Dashboard",
        icon: "🎨",
        url: "http://localhost:PORT",
        description: "What this dashboard does...",
        features: ["Feature 1", "Feature 2"],
        knowledgeLevels: ["beginner", "intermediate", "advanced"],
        statusEndpoint: "http://localhost:PORT/health",
        external: true
    }
];
```

