### AI Services

3. **Bob & Alice** (`http://localhost:5188`)
   - AI conversations
   - Character dialogue
   - All knowledge levels

4. **Gemini Tools (VeoGen)** (`http://localhost:6241`)
   - Video generation
   - Image creation
   - Music generation
   - All knowledge levels

### Utilities

5. **MyWienerLinien** (`http://localhost:3079`)
   - Vienna transport map
   - Real-time data
   - All knowledge levels

### Monitoring

6. **Grafana** (`http://localhost:3100`)
   - Metrics dashboards
   - Log aggregation
   - Intermediate/Advanced

7. **Prometheus** (`http://localhost:9191`)
   - Metrics collection
   - Time series data
   - Advanced only

